        "heading": "Sticky rollers <em>can't keep up</em>",
        "text": "<p>You tear off sheet after sheet and the couch still looks furry. Furlo's ratchet head works like a tiny comb: roll it forward and back, and the bristles sweep fur up into a sealed chamber.</p>",
